  "text": "Subsurface by Hal Strode Art for the Anthropocene Golden Earth Studio is a platform for creatives and landscape developers to embrace circularity. Gallery Teoju by Jihyun Kim Bull's Matter by Zahed Tajeddin Bowl by Louis VIncent Chopsticks by Rickie Cheuk Explore Our Featured Artists We work with established artists whose practice is deeply rooted in material exploration, skillfully translating their knowledge and research into fine art and functional ware. Louis Vincent Jihyun Kim Jacob Chan The Collective Extending an invitation to all who are intrigued by the possbilities within the consutrction industry’s abundance of discarded resources, Golden Earth Studio engages with creatives from a wide range of disciplines. Explore the many ways circularity has been embraced through across multiple mediums through our collective. The Journal Golden Earth Studio is an ever-evolving initiative, seizing new opportunities to collaborate, innovate and make an impact wherever and however we can. Our Journal is a documentation of past & future events, where we extend invitations to engage actively, broadcast the availability of waste materials and unveil new art works. First Name Last Name Email Subject Message Send contact us As an art collector looking to acquire their next bespoke piece or an artist seeking low impact materials to incorporate into their practice, we await your message to plan your next steps.",
